al boxer, but he was ruined and become an itinerant boxer. However, Genki believed his father was strong and he would become a champion, and he had a dream to become a strong boxer as his father.\n\nAfter his father’s death, he was adopted by his grandparents. Although they opposed Genki boxing, Genki made up his mind to become a boxer, and he continued training secretly. Meeting with various people, for example, Teacher Ashikiwa who resembles his mother, Mishima who is a high school boxing champion, he made his way to be a boxer.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Boxing","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Ganbare Genki","english":null,"native":"がんばれ元気","romaji":"Ganbare Genki","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"小神拳"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}